WEBVTT

00:00:44.620 --> 00:00:46.740
<b>I'm amazed we got permission to exhume the body.</b>

00:00:46.740 --> 00:00:50.830
<b>You have it reversed. They hindered our investigation by burying him in the first place.</b>

00:00:50.830 --> 00:00:54.740
<b>Yes, sir. Still, a military cemetery...</b>

00:00:55.420 --> 00:00:59.140
<b>It's ridiculously expensive to dispose of a prosthetic body that can't be reused.</b>

00:00:59.890 --> 00:01:02.260
<b>Thanks to their cost-cutting, we can recover the cyberbrain.</b>

00:01:03.310 --> 00:01:04.160
<b>Where are the engineers?</b>

00:01:06.230 --> 00:01:08.140
<b>Drawing straws at HQ.</b>

00:01:08.140 --> 00:01:12.100
<b>Apparently connecting to a dead criminal's cyberbrain is "creepy."</b>

00:01:12.100 --> 00:01:14.090
<b>We don't know yet that he's a criminal.</b>

00:01:14.690 --> 00:01:15.700
<b>Chief Aramaki!</b>

00:01:16.270 --> 00:01:18.550
<b>We'll check the contents, then take it back to headquarters.</b>

00:01:25.040 --> 00:01:27.270
<b>What are you waiting for? Put it down!</b>

00:01:28.920 --> 00:01:29.890
<b>Sorry, sir!</b>

00:01:31.380 --> 00:01:33.160
<b>Don't open that coffin!</b>

00:03:23.660 --> 00:03:25.350
<b>This is from your unit.</b>

00:04:11.200 --> 00:04:12.770
<b>Are you military?</b>

00:04:16.630 --> 00:04:19.410
<b>I'm Aramaki, with Public Security Section 9.</b>

00:04:19.410 --> 00:04:21.460
<b>We're investigating Lieutenant Colonel Mamuro's murder.</b>

00:04:21.460 --> 00:04:25.450
<b>I'm seizing his cyberbrain and prosthetic body as evidence.</b>

00:04:25.830 --> 00:04:30.550
<b>He's also suspected of taking bribes, which we are also investigating.</b>

00:04:30.550 --> 00:04:32.970
<b>Public Security has no right to ransack this place.</b>

00:04:32.970 --> 00:04:35.320
<b>We'll bury him again when the case is closed.</b>

00:04:35.320 --> 00:04:38.190
<b>And how do I know you won't pull a cover-up, or fabricate evidence?</b>

00:04:38.860 --> 00:04:42.670
<b>The military is in the middle of its first major shakeup since the war.</b>

00:04:43.100 --> 00:04:47.240
<b>It would be more suspicious if this only got an internal investigation.</b>

00:04:47.860 --> 00:04:50.890
<b>If he were still with us, Mamuro would have been the first to say so.</b>

00:04:51.440 --> 00:04:53.110
<b>You knew him?</b>

00:04:53.110 --> 00:04:55.700
<b>Yes, back when I was in the Army.</b>

00:04:55.700 --> 00:04:59.110
<b>There's not a soldier in the world more squeaky-clean than he was.</b>

00:05:04.260 --> 00:05:06.470
<b>Your name and unit?</b>

00:05:08.350 --> 00:05:12.450
<b>Major Motoko Kusanagi, Unit 501.</b>

00:05:13.730 --> 00:05:17.330
<b>501? So you were his subordinate.</b>

00:05:19.860 --> 00:05:21.040
<b>Open it up.</b>

00:05:21.770 --> 00:05:24.140
<b>Can l ask your rank?</b>

00:05:24.140 --> 00:05:26.770
<b>I was in the old Investigations Section. That's all.</b>

00:05:26.770 --> 00:05:30.510
<b>They sold off whatever wouldn't fit in the coffin to a junk shop.</b>

00:05:42.920 --> 00:05:44.070
<b>That's not his body!</b>

00:06:08.740 --> 00:06:10.050
<b>Get down!</b>

00:07:02.210 --> 00:07:04.740
<b>Finally back on base, you delinquent?</b>

00:07:05.410 --> 00:07:08.330
<b>Why did you authorize Public Security's involvement?!</b>

00:07:08.330 --> 00:07:12.580
<b>Since l can't dismiss the possibility that Mamuro was corrupt, l had no choice.</b>

00:07:12.580 --> 00:07:15.600
<b>Unit 501 should be investigating this!</b>

00:07:16.530 --> 00:07:19.290
<b>The higher-ups told us to stay out of it.</b>

00:07:20.760 --> 00:07:23.390
<b>Someone set a trap at his grave.</b>

00:07:23.390 --> 00:07:24.390
<b>Ignore it.</b>

00:07:24.390 --> 00:07:26.420
<b>His cyberbrain is gone!</b>

00:07:26.980 --> 00:07:29.070
<b>This isn't the time to stir up a hornet's nest.</b>

00:07:30.200 --> 00:07:33.360
<b>Then you believe that he was taking dirty money?</b>

00:07:33.360 --> 00:07:36.890
<b>He got mugged downtown. That much is fact.</b>

00:07:37.230 --> 00:07:42.520
<b>Not an honorable death, but compared to indictment, maybe he got lucky.</b>

00:07:42.520 --> 00:07:46.280
<b>Thanks to him, our letters of recommendation are on hold, too.</b>

00:07:46.280 --> 00:07:48.210
<b>Concentrate on your work for now.</b>

00:07:48.850 --> 00:07:49.820
<b>Work?</b>

00:07:50.830 --> 00:07:55.280
<b>l distinctly remember asking you to analyze that infected hardware.</b>

00:07:55.750 --> 00:07:59.750
<b>Not possible. l just got back to Japan today, you know.</b>

00:08:01.520 --> 00:08:03.300
<b>True enough.</b>

00:08:03.300 --> 00:08:04.930
<b>I'll take care of it.</b>

00:08:04.930 --> 00:08:07.790
<b>In return, give me leave to go off-base and authorize direct debit.</b>

00:08:08.610 --> 00:08:10.170
<b>What a difficult child you are.</b>

00:08:10.570 --> 00:08:13.090
<b>I'm only going to find out who set the trap.</b>

00:08:13.990 --> 00:08:17.620
<b>Very well. I'll take care of it in Mamuro's place.</b>

00:08:17.620 --> 00:08:19.220
<b>Thanks, Kurutsu.</b>

00:08:21.080 --> 00:08:23.600
<b>Don't forget your meeting with the brass.</b>

00:09:50.540 --> 00:09:56.120
<b><i>Giichi Mamuro, member of a special unit of the GSDA, <i>was murdered on the fifth of this month.</i></i></b>

00:09:56.120 --> 00:09:59.640
<b><i>Niihama police say the investigation into his possible corruption is ongoing.</i></b>

00:09:56.510 --> 00:09:59.640
<b><i>Lieutenant Colonel Mamuro is suspected of taking large bribes</i></b>

00:09:59.640 --> 00:10:03.290
<b><i>while serving as a security official in Harimadara's weapons export—</i></b>

00:10:39.380 --> 00:10:42.040
<b>Access records of the Lieutenant Colonel's movements on the day of his death</b>

00:10:42.040 --> 00:10:44.160
<b>and all data from city surveillance cameras.</b>

00:11:12.790 --> 00:11:13.980
<b>He was tailed.</b>

00:11:14.470 --> 00:11:18.490
<b>Scan anyone who took the same route he did before time of death.</b>

00:11:23.680 --> 00:11:24.830
<b>Three...</b>

00:11:35.290 --> 00:11:36.250
<b>A fourth?</b>

00:12:09.430 --> 00:12:13.000
<b><i>Three men and a mobile land mine were following him?</i></b>

