00:12:25.410 --> 00:12:26.910
<b><i>What's this?</i></b>

00:12:28.990 --> 00:12:29.970
<b>Any pain?</b>

00:12:30.540 --> 00:12:32.740
<b>Not right now, no.</b>

00:12:32.740 --> 00:12:36.160
<b>It's similar to the phantom pain particular to cyborgs,</b>

00:12:36.160 --> 00:12:38.790
<b>but that should not affect you.</b>

00:12:38.790 --> 00:12:41.400
<b>Could be a bad contact in your nervous components.</b>

00:12:41.580 --> 00:12:43.590
<b>Any other abnormalities?</b>

00:12:49.850 --> 00:12:50.710
<b>No.</b>

00:12:51.590 --> 00:12:54.050
<b>We should do a full-body checkup to be safe.</b>

00:12:54.050 --> 00:12:58.310
<b>Thank you, but I have a meeting to go to.</b>

00:13:02.820 --> 00:13:05.380
<b>Goodness, you have visitors.</b>

00:13:06.190 --> 00:13:08.260
<b>They announced themselves as Public Security Section 9.</b>

00:13:08.560 --> 00:13:09.950
<b>Say I'm not here.</b>

