00:13:17.010 --> 00:13:22.160
<b>new regulations apply to you under the revised Weapons Act.</b>

00:13:22.160 --> 00:13:27.250
<b>The Prosthetics Maintenance Rule now applies to issuing identification,</b>

00:13:27.250 --> 00:13:31.880
<b>possessing cash, opening bank accounts, or other ownership of assets.</b>

00:13:31.880 --> 00:13:37.830
<b>In Lt. Col. Mamuro's letter on my reclassification, he guaranteed my financial autonomy.</b>

00:13:38.010 --> 00:13:41.930
<b>If he's proven corrupt, he'll receive a dishonorable discharge,</b>

00:13:41.930 --> 00:13:43.800
<b>and all such documents will be void.</b>

00:13:44.480 --> 00:13:49.760
<b>You expect me to endure a position where l have to file paperwork every time l open my wallet?</b>

00:13:50.110 --> 00:13:53.820
<b>The cost of prosthetic bodies far exceeds standard health insurance payouts.</b>

00:13:53.820 --> 00:13:58.190
<b>You ought to do your duty to the government which guarantees your right to life.</b>

00:13:58.360 --> 00:14:01.900
<b>This is the consent form for your monitoring and custody post-restructuring.</b>

00:14:02.240 --> 00:14:04.710
<b>Make an effort to understand your circumstances.</b>

00:14:17.850 --> 00:14:23.220
<b>During the war, Japan allocated a sky-high budget to promote cyborg development.</b>

00:14:23.220 --> 00:14:27.050
<b>Did they tell you to become Army property to foot the bill?</b>

00:14:28.610 --> 00:14:31.780
<b>There were large deposits made to Mamuro's accounts.</b>

00:14:31.780 --> 00:14:37.570
<b>But after his murder, someone withdrew all that money.</b>

00:14:37.570 --> 00:14:39.340
<b>What do you want?</b>

00:14:39.340 --> 00:14:44.580
<b>Major Kusanagi, of Unit 501. No criminal record.</b>

00:14:44.580 --> 00:14:48.250
<b>You work with the Army and Public Security as a special consultant.</b>

00:14:48.250 --> 00:14:51.490
<b>You specialize in solving cybercrimes.</b>

00:14:58.770 --> 00:15:02.640
<b>l request that you track down the missing money and analyze the coffin records.</b>

00:15:02.640 --> 00:15:05.920
<b>Since it's an official investigation, you should get leave to go off-base.</b>

00:15:06.940 --> 00:15:08.100
<b>What's the pay?</b>

00:15:08.100 --> 00:15:12.480
<b>I'll give you the regular consulting fee, as a civilian.</b>

00:15:12.480 --> 00:15:13.930
<b>That'll be an issue, you know.</b>

00:15:14.320 --> 00:15:18.850
<b>A soldier famous for his integrity being shot to death in secret is a much bigger one.</b>

00:15:29.590 --> 00:15:31.250
<b>Hey! How dare you?!</b>

00:15:31.250 --> 00:15:34.950
<b>Tomorrow morning, l'll send you a liaison who'll double as a bodyguard.</b>

00:15:36.130 --> 00:15:37.590
<b>Think she's in?</b>

00:15:37.590 --> 00:15:39.970
<b>She's as in the dark as we are.</b>

00:15:39.970 --> 00:15:42.980
<b>If she wants to be free, she'll have to find out the truth.</b>

00:15:49.070 --> 00:15:50.880
<b>Still don't want the 501 to investigate?</b>

00:15:51.690 --> 00:15:54.850
<b>Make one wrong move, and our unit could get dissolved.</b>

00:15:55.230 --> 00:15:56.890
<b>Public Security offered me an assignment.</b>

00:15:57.400 --> 00:15:58.690
<b>Will you accept?</b>

00:15:58.690 --> 00:16:00.150
<b>Lend me a hand.</b>

00:16:00.150 --> 00:16:03.740
<b>If you can't get it done alone, you'll be at the end of the line.</b>

00:16:03.740 --> 00:16:06.660
<b>No one else will be able to protect you then.</b>

00:16:06.660 --> 00:16:10.200
<b>Being protected isn't what I learned to do here!</b>

00:16:10.200 --> 00:16:12.300
<b>l learned to make the most of my abilities!</b>

00:16:14.930 --> 00:16:17.490
<b>I'll grant permission for you to use Server 6.</b>

00:16:18.050 --> 00:16:19.240
<b>Thanks.</b>

00:16:19.920 --> 00:16:21.930
<b>Just don't forget the job l gave you.</b>

00:16:29.070 --> 00:16:31.380
<b><i>List the people working on the case.</i></b>

00:16:31.810 --> 00:16:35.350
<b>But this is clearly related to the Lt. Col.'s mugging!</b>

00:16:35.350 --> 00:16:37.590
<b>We know he met up with the prostitute.</b>

00:16:37.590 --> 00:16:39.230
<b>We need a warrant for her cust—</b>

00:16:39.230 --> 00:16:42.230
<b>It's military jurisdiction! You keep out of it!</b>

00:16:42.780 --> 00:16:46.170
<b>You just forget this case, you hear me? That's an order!</b>

00:16:49.630 --> 00:16:52.800
<b>Then what's a special investigator even for, dammit?!</b>

00:16:55.030 --> 00:16:58.280
The Lt. Col. was being followed.

00:16:58.280 --> 00:16:58.330
The Lt. Col. was being followed.

00:16:58.330 --> 00:16:58.370
The Lt. Col. was being followed.

00:16:58.370 --> 00:16:58.580
The Lt. Col. was being followed.

00:16:59.180 --> 00:16:59.990
<b>What?!</b>

00:17:20.370 --> 00:17:23.020
<b>Hey! S-Stop right there!</b>

00:17:39.640 --> 00:17:40.330
<b>There you are!</b>

00:17:50.570 --> 00:17:53.590
<b>Well, if it isn't the little tomboy from the lab.</b>

00:17:59.490 --> 00:18:03.020
<b>The one who infiltrated me... is in that car!</b>

00:18:09.630 --> 00:18:11.520
<b>You fool! That makes you a deserter!</b>

00:18:17.170 --> 00:18:19.080
<b>Stop, Raizo!</b>

00:18:19.080 --> 00:18:21.130
<b>All right, Kusanagi?</b>

00:18:21.130 --> 00:18:22.450
<b>Instructor Ibachi...</b>

00:18:23.060 --> 00:18:26.830
<b>Don't think you can do whatever you want just because you were Mamuro's favorite!</b>

00:18:27.760 --> 00:18:31.000
<b>Your selfish actions put the whole unit in danger!</b>

00:18:31.260 --> 00:18:35.230
<b>That's enough! l'll be the one to lecture her.</b>

00:18:37.320 --> 00:18:40.410
<b>That bitch only survived as a test subject.</b>

00:18:45.870 --> 00:18:48.190
<b>The number is a fake. He's a slippery customer.</b>

00:18:48.700 --> 00:18:52.070
<b>We've proven there was an infiltrator, at least.</b>

00:18:52.070 --> 00:18:53.870
<b>What does Kurutsu say?</b>

00:18:53.870 --> 00:18:55.340
<b>"Ignore it."</b>

00:18:57.050 --> 00:18:58.150
<b>Is your prosthetic body acting up?</b>

00:19:01.260 --> 00:19:02.920
<b>I don't know.</b>

00:19:02.920 --> 00:19:04.590
<b>Goodness, another visitor.</b>

00:19:04.590 --> 00:19:06.750
<b>You've got a strange one here to see you.</b>

00:19:11.020 --> 00:19:12.130
<b>What is this?</b>

00:19:17.280 --> 00:19:21.010
<b>It uses signal lights? How old is this thing?</b>

00:19:23.620 --> 00:19:24.870
<b>Here, come with me.</b>

00:19:37.510 --> 00:19:41.130
<b>Construct your learning base yourself.</b>

00:19:47.310 --> 00:19:49.220
<b>Hello, nice to meet you!</b>

00:19:49.220 --> 00:19:55.170
<b>I'm an autonomous-follower logistics system: a "Logistics Conveyor Machine".</b>

00:19:55.470 --> 00:19:59.380
<b>You're Section 9's "liaison who'll double as a bodyguard?"</b>

00:19:59.520 --> 00:20:02.520
<b>Chief Aramaki calls me a "Logicoma!"</b>

00:20:02.520 --> 00:20:07.150
<b>You'll be receiving information through me, Major Kusanagi.</b>

00:20:07.150 --> 00:20:11.780
<b>No syncing. Explain things orally or as data.</b>

00:20:11.780 --> 00:20:17.030
<b>Um... Any Army case information on the group identified as illicit arms dealers</b>

00:20:17.030 --> 00:20:21.070
<b>would be very useful to Chief Aramaki in tracking down a mobile land mine!</b>

00:20:21.500 --> 00:20:24.030
<b>The Army? Arms dealers?</b>

00:20:24.460 --> 00:20:26.240
<b>Yes, sir!</b>

00:20:29.060 --> 00:20:31.880
<b>You disappear. l'll take it from here.</b>

00:20:31.880 --> 00:20:34.390
<b>Order acknowledged!</b>

00:20:36.190 --> 00:20:37.420
<b>Optical camouflage?</b>

00:20:46.490 --> 00:20:48.400
<b>Stay here and guard my motorcycle.</b>

00:20:48.400 --> 00:20:49.680
<b>Right!</b>

00:20:53.750 --> 00:20:57.790
<b>Come on, walk straight! Look, we're almost there.</b>

00:21:04.010 --> 00:21:05.280
<b>Hi there!</b>

00:21:05.880 --> 00:21:06.830
<b>Come on in.</b>

00:21:06.830 --> 00:21:09.920
<b>It's not even dinnertime, and this guy's three sheets to the wind!</b>

00:21:09.920 --> 00:21:12.260
<b>Get him something cold, okay?</b>

00:21:12.260 --> 00:21:15.640
<b>Come on, get it together! Sit up straight!</b>

00:21:28.200 --> 00:21:29.220
<b>l fold.</b>

00:21:29.650 --> 00:21:31.280
<b>Gonna go hit the can.</b>

00:21:31.280 --> 00:21:32.990
<b>Hey, no fair!</b>

00:21:32.990 --> 00:21:34.730
<b>But you had a great hand!</b>

00:21:41.170 --> 00:21:42.010
<b>There.</b>

00:21:49.010 --> 00:21:50.590
<b>Warning! Warning!</b>

00:21:50.590 --> 00:21:52.990
<b>Someone approaching, extremely close!</b>

00:21:55.850 --> 00:21:58.540
<b>Don't move. Who sent you?!</b>

00:22:17.540 --> 00:22:19.810
<b>Were you the ones who killed Lt. Col. Mamuro?</b>

00:22:20.070 --> 00:22:21.990
<b>Huh? Are you Public Security?</b>

00:22:21.990 --> 00:22:23.010
<b>Answer me!</b>

00:22:23.660 --> 00:22:29.710
<b>First you check the Army database! Code 24, Ops H2976...</b>

00:22:29.710 --> 00:22:31.620
<b>...code name Paz!</b>

00:22:32.930 --> 00:22:34.640
<b>You're undercover?!</b>

00:22:35.680 --> 00:22:40.090
<b>Yeah, the group I'm in with was hired for a hit.</b>

00:22:40.090 --> 00:22:44.600
<b>They said the target was a full cyborg and his cyberbrain had to be destroyed, so we'd use mobile land mines.</b>

00:22:44.600 --> 00:22:46.670
<b>Three of 'em—and I'm talking military-grade.</b>

00:22:47.730 --> 00:22:49.630
<b>Lt. Col. Mamuro's murder?</b>

00:22:50.150 --> 00:22:54.400
<b>Who knows? Apparently somebody beat our guys to it,</b>

00:22:54.400 --> 00:22:56.610
<b>and we let the mines get away.</b>

00:22:56.610 --> 00:22:58.050
<b>Where did the mines come from?</b>

00:22:58.770 --> 00:23:00.950
<b>Maneuver Area 6.</b>

00:23:00.950 --> 00:23:05.590
<b>That place is a joke. Might as well set foxes to guard a henhouse.</b>

00:23:07.420 --> 00:23:09.570
<b>Feel like proving it with me?</b>

00:23:11.890 --> 00:23:15.000
<b>This ain't the best job, but I can't just drop it.</b>

00:23:15.000 --> 00:23:19.130
<b>I'd be in danger, and I'd cause trouble for my CO.</b>

00:23:19.130 --> 00:23:21.270
<b>ls your CO trustworthy?</b>

00:23:22.690 --> 00:23:24.040
<b>Used to be.</b>

00:23:26.440 --> 00:23:27.200
<b>l see.</b>

00:23:29.650 --> 00:23:31.140
<b>Thanks for your cooperation.</b>

00:23:32.530 --> 00:23:34.890
<b>l wish l had your freedom of movement.</b>

00:23:46.000 --> 00:23:47.570
<b>You can't analyze it?</b>

00:23:48.000 --> 00:23:49.460
<b>It might just be noise.</b>

00:24:09.530 --> 00:24:14.940
<b>No full-body cyborg gets to leave this organization and go independent.</b>

00:24:14.940 --> 00:24:18.080
<b>You're just a girl with a little talent for cyber warfare.</b>

00:24:19.400 --> 00:24:21.900
<b>Mamuro's death was an inevitability.</b>

00:24:21.900 --> 00:24:25.290
<b>Don't step out of line, or I'll take you out.</b>

00:24:26.510 --> 00:24:29.190
<b>Kurutsu and Ibachi can't shield you from me.</b>

00:24:30.510 --> 00:24:31.650
<b>An inevitability...</b>

