00:25:24.100 --> 00:25:26.480
<b>Their security's a joke, all right.</b>

00:25:39.780 --> 00:25:42.610
<b>All that's left is to connect the dots...</b>

00:25:42.610 --> 00:25:46.950
<b>Look, I've got authorization! And all I'm gonna do is ask questions!</b>

00:25:46.950 --> 00:25:48.480
<b>Take your complaints to the station.</b>

00:25:49.760 --> 00:25:54.760
<b>Where does he get off? It ain't like I've never been deployed, dammit...</b>

