<b>This is bullshit! They're not even he—</b>

00:26:03.580 --> 00:26:09.040
<b>F{*\c&H181D24&}i{*\c&H171C24&}r{*\c&H171B24&}e {*\c&H151924&}hy{*\c&H141824&}d{*\c&H131724&}r{*\c&H131624&}a{*\c&H121524&}nt</b>

00:26:05.810 --> 00:26:09.040
<b>Ah, sorry. I'm a special investigator with the Niihama police.</b>

00:26:10.050 --> 00:26:11.750
<b>l was told l could find these two here.</b>

00:26:13.060 --> 00:26:15.280
<b>I have some questions for First Lieutenant Seta Moto</b>

00:26:15.280 --> 00:26:17.730
<b>and Captain Amuri Noto here—</b>

00:26:17.730 --> 00:26:20.390
<b>Thanks. You just connected some dots.</b>

00:26:20.390 --> 00:26:27.890
<b>F{*\c&H181D24&}i{*\c&H171C24&}r{*\c&H171B24&}e {*\c&H151924&}hy{*\c&H141824&}d{*\c&H131724&}r{*\c&H131624&}a{*\c&H121524&}nt</b>

00:26:21.730 --> 00:26:27.890
<b>And l see some others just connected. How about showing yourself?</b>

00:26:34.630 --> 00:26:35.940
<b>Batou the Ranger?</b>

00:26:37.040 --> 00:26:41.410
<b>Long time no see. Gotta say l didn't figure you for this one.</b>

00:26:42.250 --> 00:26:43.840
<b>What do you mean?</b>

00:26:43.840 --> 00:26:47.600
<b>The man you killed seven days ago was a comrade of mine!</b>

00:26:48.720 --> 00:26:51.380
<b>I just got back to Japan three days ago.</b>

00:26:51.380 --> 00:26:52.640
<b>Oh, really?!</b>

00:27:13.790 --> 00:27:19.410
<b>I've told you before how easy your sleepless eye is to infiltrate.</b>

00:27:19.410 --> 00:27:22.210
<b>Still afraid of taking friendly fire out in the jungle?</b>

00:27:23.090 --> 00:27:25.630
<b>I'm an electronic warfare specialist too!</b>

00:27:25.630 --> 00:27:28.840
<b>I can't believe you infiltrated me in the middle of a fight!</b>

00:27:28.840 --> 00:27:32.440
<b>You're just about the only one who'd infiltrate me.</b>

00:27:32.440 --> 00:27:35.000
<b>So, why are you after me?</b>

00:27:35.180 --> 00:27:36.520
<b>Don't play dumb!</b>

00:27:36.520 --> 00:27:39.550
<b>You're the one who got this place's mobile land mines!</b>

00:27:44.240 --> 00:27:45.380
<b>What the hell?!</b>

00:27:53.730 --> 00:27:54.630
<b>Wait!</b>

00:27:55.080 --> 00:27:56.880
<b>Don't shoot! Run!</b>

00:28:08.640 --> 00:28:09.200
<b>Don't!</b>

00:28:36.540 --> 00:28:38.540
<b>Those guys aren't with you?!</b>

00:28:38.540 --> 00:28:40.370
<b>Seriously, what are you talking about?</b>

00:28:40.370 --> 00:28:42.110
<b>Hey, look!</b>

00:28:46.550 --> 00:28:47.760
<b>They found us!</b>

00:28:48.930 --> 00:28:50.510
<b>They want to eliminate us here.</b>

00:28:50.510 --> 00:28:52.630
<b>And their excuse will be a "training exercise accident?"</b>

00:28:52.630 --> 00:28:55.250
<b>I can't stop 'em with this puny gun!</b>

00:28:58.320 --> 00:28:59.860
<b>We'll just have to run!</b>

00:29:05.740 --> 00:29:06.900
<b>Now we climb!</b>

00:29:06.900 --> 00:29:08.020
<b>Climb this?!</b>

00:29:08.020 --> 00:29:09.600
<b>Damn straight!</b>

00:29:10.110 --> 00:29:12.690
<b>We'll hold them off, so get moving!</b>

00:29:12.690 --> 00:29:13.690
<b>Okay, fine.</b>

00:29:13.690 --> 00:29:14.740
<b>Hello!</b>

00:29:14.740 --> 00:29:15.480
<b>What's that?!</b>

00:29:18.340 --> 00:29:19.570
<b>We're surrounded.</b>

00:29:22.710 --> 00:29:24.080
<b>I told you, move it!</b>

00:29:24.080 --> 00:29:25.530
<b>I know, I know!</b>

00:29:35.890 --> 00:29:36.830
<b>Get in!</b>

00:29:56.500 --> 00:29:58.400
<b>l thought you "couldn't drop it?"</b>

00:29:58.570 --> 00:30:01.000
<b>This makes a nice change of pace.</b>

00:30:19.980 --> 00:30:23.140
<b>You asked the military police for help?</b>

00:30:23.140 --> 00:30:24.960
<b>To escort a suspect.</b>

00:30:26.310 --> 00:30:27.600
<b>What's this about?</b>

00:30:34.700 --> 00:30:36.570
<b>This makes no sense.</b>

00:30:36.570 --> 00:30:41.860
<b>Firstly: the missing money went to your account, Major Kusanagi.</b>

00:30:42.160 --> 00:30:46.460
<b>Secondly: the bullet you fired on the mobile land mine at the graveyard</b>

00:30:46.460 --> 00:30:49.360
<b>matched the one that killed Lt. Col. Mamuro.</b>

00:30:49.670 --> 00:30:53.370
<b>Seven days ago, a prostitute here in town was shot to death.</b>

00:30:53.920 --> 00:30:56.450
<b>The bullet matched the one that killed Mamuro.</b>

00:30:56.800 --> 00:31:00.090
<b>Mamuro had met with her, and according to the other working girls,</b>

00:31:00.090 --> 00:31:03.090
<b>he was asking questions about one of her clients.</b>

00:31:03.390 --> 00:31:06.890
<b>Seven days ago, one of my fellow Rangers</b>

00:31:06.890 --> 00:31:09.530
<b>was killed by a mobile land mine, along with his family.</b>

00:31:12.450 --> 00:31:15.680
<b>He'd been in contact with Mamuro, too.</b>

00:31:15.980 --> 00:31:20.600
<b>And when l traced the land mine to its source, it led me to the major here.</b>

00:31:21.110 --> 00:31:24.370
<b>By the way, she says she got back to Japan three days ago,</b>

00:31:24.370 --> 00:31:26.980
<b>but Immigration records say it was seven days ago.</b>

00:31:26.980 --> 00:31:30.000
<b>The three mines my group was supposed to use</b>

00:31:30.000 --> 00:31:33.210
<b>were the same model as the one Section 9 dug up at the graveyard.</b>

00:31:33.210 --> 00:31:36.910
<b>Assuming one of those three was buried and another killed the Ranger,</b>

00:31:37.340 --> 00:31:39.670
<b>there's one more left unaccounted for.</b>

00:31:39.670 --> 00:31:43.760
<b>At the moment, all the clues point to you murdering Mamuro</b>

00:31:43.760 --> 00:31:45.880
<b>and stealing his money.</b>

00:31:47.570 --> 00:31:53.340
<b>Right after l landed, l got a message and an attaché case from him.</b>

00:31:53.340 --> 00:31:58.220
<b>I'm sorry, Major Kusanagi. I doubt I'll be in this world much longer.</b>

00:32:00.160 --> 00:32:02.770
<b>I wanted to get justice.</b>

00:32:03.120 --> 00:32:05.730
<b>I've left your recommendation in someone else's care.</b>

00:32:07.120 --> 00:32:12.500
<b>You're the most promising squad member l know. l wish you luck.</b>

00:32:12.500 --> 00:32:17.120
<b>In the case, I found data on an internal weapons exportation racket...</b>

00:32:17.880 --> 00:32:19.800
<b>...and this gun.</b>

00:32:19.800 --> 00:32:23.620
<b>You've moved a lot of money in the past few days.</b>

00:32:24.390 --> 00:32:25.920
<b>Who are you sending it to?</b>

00:32:27.010 --> 00:32:30.090
<b>The widow of the man who raised me.</b>

00:32:30.680 --> 00:32:35.280
<b>She's taken care of me since l was little, but she's in a nursing home now.</b>

00:32:36.060 --> 00:32:37.850
<b>What's her name?</b>

00:32:39.870 --> 00:32:41.680
<b>What is this woman's name?</b>

00:32:55.340 --> 00:32:57.240
<b>Phantom pain, huh?</b>

00:32:57.500 --> 00:33:01.330
<b>Even after you mechanize your body, your brain never forgets the original.</b>

00:33:02.130 --> 00:33:03.880
<b>Pain in the ass.</b>

00:33:03.880 --> 00:33:06.220
<b>I don't have an "original" body.</b>

00:33:06.220 --> 00:33:07.640
<b>What?</b>

00:33:07.640 --> 00:33:11.210
<b>Have you heard of Doctor Bakeru's emergency medicine system?</b>

00:33:11.520 --> 00:33:13.360
<b>That thing where someone with a full prosthetic body</b>

00:33:13.360 --> 00:33:16.930
<b>uses their life-support system on somebody else?</b>

00:33:17.990 --> 00:33:23.520
<b>The person who raised me used it on me while I was in my mother's womb.</b>

00:33:28.460 --> 00:33:34.110
<b>Supposedly a chemical weapon killed a large number of civilians way back when.</b>

00:33:34.250 --> 00:33:38.080
<b>A pregnant woman and the man assumed to be her husband both died.</b>

00:33:38.080 --> 00:33:39.580
<b>We don't even know their names.</b>

00:33:40.090 --> 00:33:43.760
<b>Because someone with that particular lifesaver happened to be on the scene,</b>

00:33:43.760 --> 00:33:46.000
<b>the fetus's brain alone survived.</b>

00:33:46.430 --> 00:33:48.960
<b>You're saying you were made a full cyborg at birth?!</b>

00:33:49.470 --> 00:33:52.470
<b>I lack any memory of a body.</b>

00:33:52.470 --> 00:33:57.930
<b>So perhaps you could call this "ghost pain", created by false memories.</b>

00:34:04.660 --> 00:34:07.810
<b>This is surveillance footage from Maneuver Area 6.</b>

00:34:08.030 --> 00:34:10.360
<b>Your subordinate is in it.</b>

00:34:10.740 --> 00:34:13.080
<b>If you refuse to hand her over,</b>

00:34:13.080 --> 00:34:16.490
<b>I'll present you with a summons signed by the Defense Minister himself.</b>

00:34:16.670 --> 00:34:20.450
<b>I'll submit a written report at a later date. I can't hand her over.</b>

00:34:21.260 --> 00:34:23.130
<b>Vixen.</b>

00:34:23.130 --> 00:34:25.410
<b>l'll make you regret this.</b>

00:34:32.800 --> 00:34:34.640
<b>That's Kanzaki Shujiro.</b>

00:34:34.640 --> 00:34:39.650
<b>He's in charge of Maneuver Area 6, and he leads a team of special agents.</b>

00:34:39.650 --> 00:34:42.600
<b>He's also the Army's dirty go-between with the Ministry of Defense.</b>

00:34:42.940 --> 00:34:46.290
<b>Don't worry. I'll protect you.</b>

00:34:49.460 --> 00:34:50.960
<b>What's wrong?</b>

00:34:52.170 --> 00:34:53.710
<b>It's nothing.</b>

00:35:07.560 --> 00:35:11.170
<b>It's been empty from the beginning? Then where's the gun?!</b>

00:35:13.010 --> 00:35:16.140
<b>Why did I think there were whistle-blowing documents in it?!</b>

00:35:16.140 --> 00:35:17.300
<b>What about the lieutenant colonel?</b>

00:35:36.420 --> 00:35:38.150
<b>What is real?</b>

00:35:38.150 --> 00:35:39.800
<b><i>What is the truth?</i></b>

00:35:46.720 --> 00:35:48.520
<b>Where's the lieutenant colonel's cyberbrain?</b>

00:35:52.940 --> 00:35:54.370
<b>Wait, Kusanagi.</b>

00:35:54.370 --> 00:35:55.130
<b>Calm down.</b>

00:35:56.840 --> 00:36:02.680
<b>The hardware Kurutsu had me analyze matched his Net sync pattern.</b>

00:36:02.680 --> 00:36:06.150
<b>He and I were infected with the same virus, weren't we?</b>

00:36:06.150 --> 00:36:08.760
<b>With something hypothesized to be a cyber-virus.</b>

00:36:08.760 --> 00:36:11.300
<b>We speculate that it's a self-destructing Stuxnet-type</b>

00:36:11.300 --> 00:36:13.850
<b>which causes unknown dysfunction.</b>

00:36:14.450 --> 00:36:18.300
<b>"Unknown dysfunction"... You mean false memories.</b>

00:36:18.300 --> 00:36:19.940
<b>It was purely a hypothesis.</b>

00:36:19.940 --> 00:36:22.260
<b>At least, until we checked into your behavior.</b>

00:36:23.070 --> 00:36:24.990
<b><i>I just got back to Japan today, you know.</i></b>

00:36:26.480 --> 00:36:27.740
<b><i>True enough.</i></b>

00:36:28.720 --> 00:36:30.790
<b>When did I come back to Japan?</b>

00:36:30.790 --> 00:36:34.300
<b>Approximately 180 hours ago. In other words, seven days.</b>

00:36:34.300 --> 00:36:39.780
<b>And yet you continue to claim it was another day altogether.</b>

00:36:39.780 --> 00:36:41.130
<b>Route of transmission?</b>

00:36:41.130 --> 00:36:43.570
<b>It must have been contact with Mamuro's cyberbrain</b>

00:36:43.570 --> 00:36:46.260
<b>which is still with his prosthetic body.</b>

00:36:47.410 --> 00:36:49.390
<b><i>His coffin was a trap.</i></b>

00:36:50.290 --> 00:36:54.060
<b><i>And the records Public Security got of his burial show no signs of tampering.</i></b>

00:36:56.180 --> 00:36:57.940
<b>So that's how it is...</b>

00:36:59.890 --> 00:37:01.940
<b>Logicoma, sync with me.</b>

00:37:01.940 --> 00:37:03.290
<b>Are you sure?</b>

00:37:03.290 --> 00:37:07.700
<b>Just get on with it. Record my field of vision and play it back in real time.</b>

00:37:08.910 --> 00:37:10.740
<b>Roger!</b>

00:37:13.300 --> 00:37:15.750
<b><i>I see things that shouldn't be there.</i></b>

00:37:23.360 --> 00:37:26.430
<b><i>I don't see things that should be there.</i></b>

00:37:50.640 --> 00:37:52.660
<b>She was here the whole time?</b>

00:37:54.790 --> 00:37:55.410
"{*\c&H3C2E42&}S{*\c&H3C2E41&}p{*\c&H3B2E41&}e{*\c&H3B2D40&}c{*\c&H3A2D40&}i{*\c&H3A2D3F&}a{*\c&H3A2C3F&}l {*\c&H392C3D&}a{*\c&H382B3D&}g{*\c&H382B3C&}en{*\c&H372A3B&}t" {*\c&H36293A&}"{*\c&H352939&}T{*\c&H352938&}h{*\c&H352838&}e {*\c&H342837&}L{*\c&H332836&}t{*\c&H332736&}. {*\c&H322734&}C{*\c&H322634&}o{*\c&H312633&}l. {*\c&H302532&}i{*\c&H302531&}s {*\c&H2F2430&}i{*\c&H2E242F&}n{*\c&H2E232F&}n{*\c&H2E232E&}o{*\c&H2D232E&}c{*\c&H2D222D&}e{*\c&H2C222D&}n{*\c&H2C222C&}t"{implying I know where these go}{Hope this is right.}

00:38:14.780 --> 00:38:17.480
<b>This is a warrant for Major Kusanagi's arrest.</b>

00:38:20.100 --> 00:38:21.900
<b>Surrender her immediately.</b>

00:38:23.130 --> 00:38:23.230
"Special agent" \h\h\h\h\h\h\h"The Lt. Col. is innocent"

00:38:23.230 --> 00:38:23.360
"Special agent" \h\h\h\h\h\h\h"The Lt. Col. is innocent"

00:38:23.360 --> 00:38:23.480
"Special agent" \h\h\h\h\h\h\h"The Lt. Col. is innocent"

00:38:23.480 --> 00:38:23.610
"Special agent" \h\h\h\h\h\h\h"The Lt. Col. is innocent"

00:38:23.610 --> 00:38:23.730
"Special agent" \h\h\h\h\h\h\h"The Lt. Col. is innocent"

00:38:23.730 --> 00:38:23.980
"Special agent" \h\h\h\h\h\h\h"The Lt. Col. is innocent"

00:38:23.980 --> 00:38:24.110
"Special agent" \h\h\h\h\h\h\h"The Lt. Col. is innocent"

00:38:24.110 --> 00:38:27.070
"Special agent" \h\h\h\h\h\h\h"The Lt. Col. is innocent"

00:38:24.740 --> 00:38:26.290
<b>What a mess!</b>

00:38:45.930 --> 00:38:47.770
<b><i>The records weren't tampered with.</i></b>

00:38:48.640 --> 00:38:52.830
<b><i>They just buried the truth under a lie.</i></b>

00:39:27.260 --> 00:39:28.420
<b>I've found it...</b>

00:39:30.100 --> 00:39:32.300
<b>My reality.</b>

00:39:41.400 --> 00:39:42.150
<b>Drive.</b>

00:39:53.190 --> 00:39:56.770
<b>The lieutenant colonel came to you to blow the whistle.</b>

00:39:56.770 --> 00:40:00.470
<b>Didn't he, Mr. Sadamoto, Vice-Minister of Defense?</b>

00:40:00.470 --> 00:40:01.540
<b>Yes.</b>

00:40:01.540 --> 00:40:03.810
<b>But you ordered a cover-up.</b>

00:40:03.810 --> 00:40:06.050
<b>Because it couldn't be made public!</b>

00:40:06.050 --> 00:40:08.720
<b>We ignored treaties and sold arms to Third World countries during the war</b>

00:40:08.720 --> 00:40:12.080
<b>to relieve its financial burden on us.</b>

00:40:12.080 --> 00:40:14.430
<b>That's governmental weapons smuggling!</b>

00:40:14.430 --> 00:40:16.980
<b>Harimadara was at the center of it,{HAIDARAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA}</b>

00:40:15.310 --> 00:40:17.690
<b>Vice-Minister, what's the matter?</b>

00:40:16.980 --> 00:40:20.390
<b>and as their security official, Lt. Col. Mamuro found out about the illegal trade.</b>

00:40:18.500 --> 00:40:19.420
<b>Vice-Minister!</b>

00:40:20.390 --> 00:40:21.490
<b>What's the matter?</b>

00:40:21.490 --> 00:40:26.190
<b>Do you realize how much the missile business has helped our country's finances?!</b>

00:40:21.660 --> 00:40:22.820
<b>He's in danger!</b>

00:40:26.190 --> 00:40:28.770
<b>The lieutenant colonel learned of your cover-up and investigated.</b>

00:40:28.770 --> 00:40:32.740
<b>The prostitute you frequented. The Ranger who escorted you.</b>

00:40:32.740 --> 00:40:36.750
<b>When he got info from them, he decided to blow the whistle on you.</b>

00:40:36.750 --> 00:40:40.480
<b>So you ordered Captain Kanzaki to kill him.</b>

00:40:40.480 --> 00:40:43.010
<b>l just ordered him to solve the situation!</b>

00:40:43.010 --> 00:40:47.830
<b>Yes, a few people suffered, but I don't know who killed Mamuro.</b>

00:40:47.830 --> 00:40:50.640
<b>Hell, maybe he really was mugged.</b>

00:40:50.640 --> 00:40:52.130
<b>You claim even you don't know?</b>

00:40:52.390 --> 00:40:54.190
<b>No, and I don't want to!</b>

00:40:54.190 --> 00:40:57.860
<b>That arms dealing will be purged during restructuring anyway,</b>

00:40:57.860 --> 00:41:01.070
<b>and we're deliberating next-generation weapons to replace missiles.</b>

00:41:01.070 --> 00:41:06.240
<b>But this mess kills the job Harimadara has lined up for when I leave office!</b>

00:41:06.240 --> 00:41:09.870
<b>You're quite the chatterbox. A desire to confess?</b>

00:41:09.870 --> 00:41:14.860
<b>Maybe so. Either way, you'll never tell anyone!</b>

00:41:21.470 --> 00:41:23.000
<b>Stop!</b>

00:41:25.230 --> 00:41:26.290
<b>Someone help!</b>

00:41:38.460 --> 00:41:40.610
<b>Should've blown him away.</b>

00:41:40.610 --> 00:41:45.140
<b>Wasn't being more than a killing machine the whole point of getting out?</b>

00:41:45.400 --> 00:41:47.940
<b>In the end, l had no place to go.</b>

00:41:48.900 --> 00:41:52.460
<b>They traced us through the remote control. They're coming.</b>

00:41:53.090 --> 00:41:55.940
<b>You go on. They're mine.</b>

00:41:56.300 --> 00:41:57.980
<b>There are two of them.</b>

00:41:57.980 --> 00:42:01.220
<b>Fine with me. We'll see who's the better killer.</b>

00:42:03.800 --> 00:42:05.360
<b>Take care.</b>

00:42:05.360 --> 00:42:06.080
<b>You too.</b>

00:42:07.740 --> 00:42:13.700
<b>I hate to say it, but they're not the only ones to benefit from his death.</b>

00:42:14.360 --> 00:42:16.260
<b>Yes. Thank you.</b>

00:43:21.630 --> 00:43:23.580
<b>You're the ones who killed the lieutenant colonel!</b>

00:43:55.890 --> 00:44:01.590
<b>I warned you that if you stepped out of line, I'd take you out.</b>

00:45:39.900 --> 00:45:41.380
<b>That's enough of that.</b>

00:45:46.580 --> 00:45:50.270
<b>You've reached your limit, Kusanagi.</b>

00:45:57.120 --> 00:46:01.440
<b>Raizo and Ibachi were luring the enemy here with the money as bait.</b>

00:46:03.820 --> 00:46:06.660
<b>We've eliminated six spies.</b>

00:46:06.660 --> 00:46:07.860
<b>That's plenty.</b>

00:46:08.270 --> 00:46:13.210
<b>Kanzaki funneled money into Mamuro's account, l moved it...</b>

00:46:13.210 --> 00:46:15.170
<b>...and you used it.</b>

00:46:15.740 --> 00:46:16.330
<b>That's right.</b>

00:46:17.340 --> 00:46:21.610
<b>The gun used on the prostitute was the beginning of the enemy plot.</b>

00:46:22.290 --> 00:46:26.270
<b>Blowing up the Ranger, the phony bribery...</b>

00:46:26.270 --> 00:46:28.570
<b>All the blame was placed on Mamuro.</b>

00:46:33.500 --> 00:46:36.940
<b>And he intended to bring the Vice-Minister down with him.</b>

00:46:37.280 --> 00:46:39.520
<b>It was the worst possible choice.</b>

00:46:39.520 --> 00:46:45.650
<b>Unit 501 would have gone on the Army purge list in retaliation for the scandal.</b>

00:46:46.320 --> 00:46:50.620
<b>So you let him die. All of you.</b>

00:47:10.870 --> 00:47:14.850
<b>If it weren't for the memory virus, maybe we could have saved him.</b>

00:47:15.770 --> 00:47:19.090
<b>But as things stood, the only option was to secure</b>

00:47:19.090 --> 00:47:23.900
<b>Mamuro's cyberbrain, the mine, and the money before he got blown up.</b>

00:47:29.420 --> 00:47:35.160
<b>But what neither we nor the enemy accounted for was you.</b>

00:47:36.600 --> 00:47:42.330
<b>As soon as I arrived and got the data, I went after the lieutenant colonel.</b>

00:47:56.150 --> 00:47:59.060
<b>And you were infected by his cyberbrain.</b>

00:48:10.170 --> 00:48:16.090
<b>Even as you gathered the evidence, you were continually losing memories.</b>

00:48:16.080 --> 00:48:16.120
