00:48:20.610 --> 00:48:23.120
<b>What organization developed the virus?</b>

00:48:23.650 --> 00:48:27.640
<b>Unclear. All we know is that a foreign broker brought it here</b>

00:48:27.640 --> 00:48:31.550
<b>and that people call it "Fire-Starter."</b>

00:48:31.550 --> 00:48:35.470
<b>Was it a foreign power that cooked up the scandal?</b>

00:48:35.470 --> 00:48:38.920
<b>Our enemy is the global military-industrial complex itself.</b>

00:48:38.920 --> 00:48:42.020
<b>What would dragging down one vice-minister accomplish?</b>

00:48:42.020 --> 00:48:45.940
<b>Did you take the disc he left me?</b>

00:48:45.940 --> 00:48:47.470
<b>l did that to protect you.</b>

00:48:47.470 --> 00:48:50.080
<b>You used me as bait for the enemy!</b>

00:48:50.080 --> 00:48:51.950
<b>l did that to protect the organization.</b>

00:48:51.950 --> 00:48:54.410
<b>Why did you stand back and watch him die?</b>

00:48:54.410 --> 00:48:56.620
<b>l did that to protect myself.</b>

00:49:06.100 --> 00:49:11.590
<b>You stick with me, Kusanagi. I'll build a future for you.</b>

00:49:21.090 --> 00:49:22.830
<b>The pain is gone now.</b>

00:49:27.730 --> 00:49:30.190
<b>Section 9 and the review committee</b>

00:49:30.190 --> 00:49:33.650
<b>have formally cleared Lt. Col. Mamuro of suspicion.</b>

00:49:33.890 --> 00:49:38.920
<b>Thus, as his recommendation was renewed by a third party, we will implement it.</b>

00:49:38.920 --> 00:49:43.370
<b>Due to your excellent record, we also grant you the post-reorganization major rank.</b>

00:49:43.600 --> 00:49:47.650
<b>In addition, in accordance with the will of your late legal guardian,</b>

00:49:47.650 --> 00:49:49.860
<b>you'll receive a testamentary trust.</b>

00:49:50.840 --> 00:49:53.660
<b>It's an inheritance from the person who raised you.</b>

00:49:53.660 --> 00:49:56.560
<b>A portion of it is earmarked for the purchase of your prosthetic body.</b>

00:49:56.560 --> 00:49:59.300
<b>Which means that your body is now your property,</b>

00:49:59.300 --> 00:50:01.400
<b>and is outside Army jurisdiction.</b>

00:50:04.160 --> 00:50:06.050
<b>You're quite sure about this?</b>

00:50:06.730 --> 00:50:08.260
<b>The virus may be an unknown,</b>

00:50:08.260 --> 00:50:11.540
<b>but we've identified the architecture of the false memories.</b>

00:50:11.540 --> 00:50:12.730
<b>Do it.</b>

00:50:13.190 --> 00:50:16.290
<b>Very well. We'll attempt memory eradication.</b>

00:51:04.450 --> 00:51:05.410
<b>Will you go?</b>

00:51:06.130 --> 00:51:07.460
<b>Yes.</b>

00:51:07.460 --> 00:51:09.370
<b>Make sure to pay your respects to your parents.</b>

00:51:11.800 --> 00:51:13.340
<b>Thanks.</b>

00:51:21.590 --> 00:51:22.570
<b>I'm going.</b>

00:51:44.830 --> 00:51:46.580
<b>We'll find a replacement.</b>

00:51:54.330 --> 00:51:55.880
<b>Want a ride?</b>

00:51:56.370 --> 00:51:59.570
<b>Consider it my thanks for telling us the location of Mamuro's cyberbrain.</b>

00:51:59.570 --> 00:52:01.310
<b>I'll take the bus.</b>

00:52:01.310 --> 00:52:03.340
<b>Then I'll just give you the results.</b>

00:52:03.340 --> 00:52:08.020
<b>Captain Kanzaki was replaced. Mr. Sadamoto will be tried in closed court.</b>

00:52:08.020 --> 00:52:12.240
<b>I promise to make the lieutenant colonel's findings public one day.</b>

00:52:12.240 --> 00:52:19.060
<b>l see. By the way, are you the one he gave my recommendation to?</b>

00:52:19.060 --> 00:52:23.120
<b>Hard to say. A man in my position gets a lot of those.</b>

00:52:23.120 --> 00:52:29.810
<b>In fact, one of them outlined plans to create a new special unit within the international rescue team.</b>

00:52:29.810 --> 00:52:33.290
<b>I'd like someone who's got experience as a special consultant.</b>

00:52:34.400 --> 00:52:39.260
<b>Intriguing, but l don't want to work under a man who digs up people's graves.</b>

00:52:39.650 --> 00:52:43.220
<b>You dug up something even deeper.</b>

00:52:43.570 --> 00:52:47.530
<b>If you're serious about going independent, you should have your own team.</b>

00:52:47.530 --> 00:52:54.290
<b>The regulations say a unit needs a minimum of one commander and six members.</b>

00:52:55.730 --> 00:52:57.130
<b>l'll keep that in mind.</b>

00:52:59.510 --> 00:53:04.380
<b>May it be a team not for defense of self or state, but for taking the offensive.</b>

